# Side Chat Workflow

- Use `/side` or `/btw` for clarification, docs lookup, and alternative exploration while the main agent runs.
- Default side chats to read/search/answer; do not start broad refactors there unless the user asks.
- Pull conclusions back into the main thread with an @-mention of the side chat when a decision is locked.
- Do not duplicate AgentCore memory writes from casual side-chat explorations.
